<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Plot Reservation Details</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f3f6fa; color: #172033; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
    .shell { width: 100%; padding: 28px 12px; box-sizing: border-box; }
    .container { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { padding: 28px 32px; background: #0b0e2d; color: #fff; }
    .brand { width: 150px; max-width: 60%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; }
    .header p { margin: 7px 0 0; color: #b9c5df; font-size: 14px; }
    .content { padding: 32px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
    .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; }
    .intro { color: #475569; }
    .section-title { margin: 28px 0 10px; color: #0b0e2d; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .details { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; overflow: hidden; }
    .details td { padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; }
    .details tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .details td:first-child { width: 38%; color: #64748b; background: #f8fafc; }
    .details td:last-child { color: #172033; font-weight: 600; }
    .notice { margin: 24px 0; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 8px; background: #fffbeb; color: #78350f; font-size: 14px; }
    .notice strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #92400e; }
    a { color: #0b7285; }
    .footer { padding: 22px 32px; background: #f8fafc; color: #64748b; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .header, .content, .footer { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; } .details td { padding: 10px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <img class="brand" src="https://getoneplot.com/logo-lateral.svg" alt="GetOnePlot">
        <h1>Plot Reservation Request</h1>
        <p>Payment instructions and plot details</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <span class="badge">Request received</span>
        <p>Dear <strong><%= firstname %> <%= lastname %></strong>,</p>
        <p class="intro">Thank you for choosing GetOnePlot. We have received your request to reserve the plot below. Please review the details and follow the payment instructions to secure your reservation.</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Selected plot</h2>
        <table class="details" role="presentation">
          <tr><td>Location</td><td><%= plotArea %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Plot details</td><td><%= plotDetails %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Plot size</td><td><%= plotSize %></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Deposit required</td><td><%= amount %></td></tr>
        </table>
        <h2 class="section-title">Payment account</h2>
        <table class="details" role="presentation">
          <tr><td>Bank</td><td>STANBIC BANK</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Account name</td><td>LAND AND HOMES CONSULT</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Cedis account</td><td>9040009771047</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Dollar account</td><td>9040011449268</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Branch</td><td>KNUST, KUMASI GHANA</td></tr>
        </table>
        <div class="notice">
          <strong>What to do next</strong>
          Make the required deposit to either account above, then bring your payment receipt to our office at Kumasi Dichemso or email it to <a href="mailto:sales@getoneplot.com">sales@getoneplot.com</a>.
        </div>
        <p class="intro">For assistance, call <strong>0322008282</strong> or <strong>+233 54 855 4216</strong>.</p>
        <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The GetOnePlot Team</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> GetOnePlot. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
